3601810","kind":"update","title":"NEW DEMO UPDATE! Gamepad and Settings","summary":"New Demo Update — Gamepad Support! 🎮❄️Hey everyone!We’ve released another demo update! This time, we focused on controls, settings, and giving you more ways to tailor the experience to your preferences.Here’s what’s changed:Added full gamepad support.Added keyboard and gamepad button remapping to the settings menu.Added difficulty selection for each mission. You can now choose an easier mode for a quicker playthrough or take on a greater challenge for the full intended experience.Added camera se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T19:23:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042789","verified_at":"2026-10-26T00:42:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1847286114030716","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"update","title":"NEXT Demo Update! ❄️","summary":"NEXT Demo Update! ❄️Hey everyone!We’ve released another demo update and are continuing to improve the game based on your feedback.Here’s what’s changed:Added a convenient new way to unload snow into the furnace. It now accepts all the snow you dump into it.Upgraded the shovel-riding mechanic to make it smoother and more fun.All available missions are now visible from the very beginning, including those that are not yet active.Updated the snow-clearing zones across all locations.Continued improvi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:44:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030716","verified_at":"2026-10-22T03:45:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1846651706692750","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"update","title":"Performance Demo Update","summary":"Performance Demo Update !Our demo has already been launched by more than 10 000 unique players!Thank you so much for playing the demo and sharing your feedback with us! We read every single review and comment.Steam Next Fest already starts, and of course, we’re taking part! So, we decided to release another demo update.Performance has been a major focus of our previous updates, and this build is no exception. We’ve continued optimizing the game while also making several changes to improve clarit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:03:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1846651706688554","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"update","title":"Another Demo Update!","summary":"Another Demo Update!Almost 400 concurrent players in our demo! WOW!But we know the game still has a long way to go. We’re reading every single review, comment, and feedback form you send us. Thank you so much!Remember how we launched Meltopia? Well, history is repeating itself! We’re pushing updates every day or every other day. The game keeps getting better, but there’s still a lot of work ahead.Here’s what we’re working hard on and plan to fix very soon:— Performance.Simulating snow movement i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:11:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1846651706679710","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"update","title":"Another Clear The Snow Demo Update! ❄️","summary":"Another Clear The Snow Demo Update! ❄️Hey everyone!We’re continuing to improve the Clear The Snow Demo! This update focuses on tutorials, controller support, effects, and performance.What’s ChangedUpdated the tutorials.Refined controller controls.Added several new visual effects.Improved the flamethrower mechanic and its visual effect.Updated the audio and SFX.Fixed visual issues in the first location.Fixed minor visual bugs.OptimizationWe’re continuing to work on performance: our tests show an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:06:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1846651706676089","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"update","title":"❄️ Clear The Snow Demo Update: New Tools and Bug Fixes! ❄️","summary":"Clear The Snow Demo Update: New Tools and Bug Fixes! ❄️Hey everyone!We’ve updated the Clear The Snow demo! We’ve added new features, worked on optimization, and fixed a number of bugs. Thanks to everyone who’s been playing and reporting issues!What’s NewAdded a new tool — the flamethrower!Added the ability to jump while riding a shovel.Added a new furnace truck.Added new sounds and music.Usability and TutorialsAdded an FPS limit and mouse sensitivity settings.Added tool fill indicators to the UI","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:05:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1825727806704698","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"announcement","title":"Meltopia DEMO is live","summary":"Hello everyone! We're happy to announce that the Meltopia demo is now available to everyone!Meltopia is our minimalist game where you'll venture into a snowy world full of mysteries and glacial secrets. Explore its vastness by melting the snow, collecting valuable resources and ancient artifacts.Go to the main Steam page and play for free right now.Join our Discord to discuss the game, report bugs, or make suggestions for improvement. We look forward to seeing you all!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-25T13:07:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806704698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601810-1824459501607561","game_id":"steam-3601810","kind":"announcement","title":"Big Event in Silicone Heart","summary":"Hey everyone! We have great news: we're launching a Kickstarter campaign for our best game — Silicone Heart together with publisher Crytivo. For the announcement, we've prepared a new trailer featuring real gameplay, atmosphere, new locations, and key mechanics. Check out the trailer: And sign up for our Kickstarter campaign:https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gardenofdreamsgames/silicone-heart","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-12T17:31:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824459501607561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3601810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3601810":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3601810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:01Z"},"5271700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"20